---

### 📄 `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# VORTEX IA — .gitignore
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# --- SYSTÈME D'EXPLOITATION & ÉDITEURS ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
.vs/

# --- PYTHON (Exécution & Cache) ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
share/python-wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
MANIFEST
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.tox/
.nox/

# --- ENVIRONNEMENTS VIRTUELS (Isolation Souveraine) ---
.venv/
venv/
ENV/
env/
.python-version

# --- SÉCURITÉ (Zéro fuite de secrets) ---
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
secrets.json
config.local.json

# --- ARTEFACTS DE TEST & LOGS ---
*.log
logs/
tmp/
temp/
*.tmp

# --- BASES DE DONNÉES LOCALES ---
*.db
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite
